[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-RO3-005
STATUS: Active
TITLE: REQ-RO3-005: Saving Ragnarok 3 settings keeps only game settings
STATEMENT: >>>
Saving Ragnarok 3 settings keeps only game settings
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
domain: Settings
priority: unspecified
type: software
constraints: No item catalog, loot limits, or priority lookback days in R3 settings.
acceptance_criteria: After an officer saves, Origin settings and workspace settings (guild name, timezone, admin roles, logo) are unchanged. | Saved Ragnarok 3 settings contain no item catalog and no priority lookback days. | Raid phases saved in the old place are moved under the raid section on save. | Saving two raid cycles that overlap is refused with 400 and nothing is stored.
source_draft: f38e137/mints-RO3.json
ssot_status: published
sot: xWhiteSpace/ROOGuildApp@f38e1378c7cca457fbf8de8e8355d59994f77fc8
counterpart (text only, not a link): REQ-ROO-166
<<<
