acceptance_criteria: A workspace with no saved Ragnarok 3 settings gets: special event categories Raid, Meeting, PVP, Casual; 5 live raid configs; 2 war rooms; attendance poll interval 5; attendance max duration 40; 3 default leave credits; empty help links; an 8 x 5 party grid; not force-locked.
