Ragnarok 3 War Room and War window use Ragnarok 3's own labels
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
domain: War Room
priority: unspecified
type: software
constraints: (none)
acceptance_criteria: The War Room shows the current War's phases from Ragnarok 3's own events (fallback names GvG Preparation, Party Adjustments, War) and lets officers update the live raid. | War-window labels on Ragnarok 3 pages come from Ragnarok 3's own events and War cycle; no Ragnarok 3 page shows Origin's current-session label. | Changing Origin's events or War cycle changes no label or phase on Ragnarok 3 pages, and changing Ragnarok 3's changes none on Origin pages. | It shows no war-room voice channel list and no voice counts. | With no published grid it tells the officer to publish a party grid from Raid Config.
