UID: REQ-RO3-019
STATUS: Active
TITLE: REQ-RO3-019: Ragnarok 3 roster follows Discord membership
STATEMENT: >>>
Ragnarok 3 roster follows Discord membership
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
domain: Discord
priority: unspecified
type: software
constraints: (none)
acceptance_criteria: When an officer syncs the Ragnarok 3 roster, every current member of the workspace's Discord server has a Ragnarok 3 roster entry showing their Discord server display name. | A Ragnarok 3 roster member who is no longer in the Discord server is marked Ghost; a Ghost member who is back in the server is marked Active again; dummy members are never marked Ghost. | A Ragnarok 3 roster sync creates or changes no Origin roster entry, and an Origin roster sync creates or changes no Ragnarok 3 roster entry. | A non-officer cannot run the Ragnarok 3 sync; the request is refused and the roster is unchanged.
source_draft: f38e137/answers-2026-10-08/mints.json
ssot_status: published
